                        "review": "Pretty good game. Good puzzles. I mean they were just right... except for the music box puzzle. Screw that! I got past it and its definitely not a deal breaker. Graphics are good. I had some problems with the game crashing because I was switching between windows (Yeah I cheated on 2 of the puzzles). Game saves often and has manual save so no biggie. I really enjoyed exploring and finding all the items. One of the more enjoyable puzzlers I've played.",
